### Register
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "college_name": "MIT",
  "department": "Computer Science",
  "year_of_study": 2
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

